This assert statement based on the comment "@@@ count of the list increases by 1 after inserting value in the array" refers to the return value of the `Insert` method in the ArrayList class. The return value is the updated size of the list (`_size + 1`) which is compared to the original size of the list (`RET`). The assumption is that the size of the list will increase by 1 after a new element is inserted.
