The comment "The size of the list increases by one after inserting value in the array" is related to the `Insert` method in the `ArrayList` class. It is asserting that the length (capacity) of the `_items` array remains the same or increases after the `Insert` method is called. The size of the array, `_size`, may increase if the array is resized, but the length of the `_items` array can never decrease. Therefore, the length of the array `_items` is sufficient to assert the increase in size of the list.
